# Prerequisites
*.d

# Dependencies fetched by scripts/bootstrap.sh and scripts/bootstrap.ps1. Their paths are recorded in
# .gitmodules, but the bootstrap clones them as ordinary repositories (the `update = none` strategy
# keeps a parent project's recursive update from downloading copies it supplies itself), so they are
# never part of a commit of this repository.
/external/
/third_party/libz/
/third_party/libyuv/
/third_party/libgtest/

